      "id": "sum-17c347",
      "kind": "origin",
      "body": "The current text is an April 2025 rewrite by elarlang, jmanico and tghosth (#2951, PR #2982): allowlist outbound communication at the application, web server, firewall, or a combination. It was written into the ID slot that had held v4 V4.3.3 (step-up authentication / anti-fraud), whose text was deleted and has no v5 successor. Anyone following the mapping file alone will be misled.",
